# Density Compare
# Samarium (Sm) — real density 7.52 g/cm³. equal masses: Samarium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Samarium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 10.2mm color: #ff9b9b at (-20mm, 5.1mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 60.0 g — the water cube is the reference
